king_paint_on_rusting_metal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Flaking_paint_on_rusting_metal.jpg/1280px-Flaking_paint_on_rusting_metal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4f/Flaking_paint_on_rusting_metal.jpg/500px-Flaking_paint_on_rusting_metal.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Flaking paint, exposing a patch of surface rust on sheet metal","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFlaking_paint_on_rusting_metal.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Rust_wedge.jpg/500px-Rust_wedge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Rust_wedge.jpg/1280px-Rust_wedge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Rust_wedge.jpg/500px-Rust_wedge.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Outdoor Rust Wedge at the Exploratorium showing the expansion of rusting iron","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ARust_wedge.jpg"}],"sounds":{"rust":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/En-us-rust.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/12/En-us-rust.ogg/En-us-rust.ogg.mp3"}],"red":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/En-uk-red.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/En-uk-red.ogg/En-uk-red.ogg.mp3"},{"type":"audi